The best hack we found is that the number of gold pieces was a signed number.
This allows you to get incredible carrying capacity, as as a result you
could be carrying a negative number of goldpieces, thus giving a negative
weight. The way to do this is:
1. d$ (drop your current gold)
2. 134217728d$ (drop 0x80000000 pieces of gold).
Now you have a negative number of goldpieces. I hope the number is correct
(it's been a long time since 1.0.3). Anyway you get the idea. 
I think this bug is/was very well known. I seem to remember that in NetHack
2.3 there was a special message when you tried this trick, something like:
    "The IRS is very interested to known how you got this amount of money"


